<title>TAJIKISTAN: Tajik Jan-May trade surplus widens to $112.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Tajik Jan-May trade surplus widens to $112.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan posted a trade surplus of $112.3 million in the first five months of this year,up from a a $26.0 million surplus in the same period of 1996,the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>TAJIK MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-May 97  Jan-Apr 97  Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Exports			   442.9	 371.5	 262.1</p>
<p>    Imports			   330.6	 251.5	 236.1</p>
<p>    Trade balance		  +112.3	+120.0	 +26.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
